# Repetitive tasks

Use `docs/TASKS.md` for the full checklists. Follow these when the user asks for a common job.

## Add or rename a page

1. Add `pagename/index.html` with unique `<title>`, description, `data-page`.
2. Register the HTML file in `vite.config.js` `build.rollupOptions.input`.
3. Add the page component, map it in `src/App.jsx`, and link it in `src/components/Layout.jsx`.
4. Update `public/.htaccess` trailing-slash redirects if needed.

## Change biography or credits

- Edit `src/data.js` first; pages should consume that data.
- Cite only publicly reported facts. Note the source in DONE.md.

## Build and publish

```bash
npm run build
```

Upload **contents** of `dist/` (not the folder) to the host document root. Confirm `/`, `/about/`, `/work/` each return 200.

## Commit / push

Only when the user asks. Do not commit `dist/` or `node_modules`.
